message: >-
  If you use DRAFT Matrix in academic, technical, or applied work,
  please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: DRAFT Matrix
abstract: >-
  A 5-dimensional invariant matrix (D0 Emergence, D1 Condition,
  D2 Conception, D3 Incarnation, D4 Experience) tracking any-domain
  Systems against epistemic degradation. Replaces ad-hoc documentation
  with a single traceable contract, auditable by humans or AI without
  loss of logical content.
